{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》下周踏入結局周，昨晚（30日）劇情高潮迭起，最緊張一幕，是在香港成功取得2,000億秘密資金的官孝君（吳卓羲飾），以勝利者姿態回歸澳門，「收拾」成魔的官孝賢（張智霖飾），令孝賢頃刻眾叛親離、權力告急。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.443707+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:03:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_hash":"62cb3053d74ab12e17ba2b0ee07fb5e4fcbee017b124f4cd0b33d9104bbaaa5e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}